** Chopper polarity-reversal proof: a DC differential input VD drives the VA pair; the
** control clock toggles at FCHOP; the VB pair (loaded resistively to VCM) must show the
** differential input FORWARD in one phase and INVERTED in the other. Measures:
**   v_fwd            differential output mid-phase-1 (clock high, straight path)
**   v_rev            differential output mid-phase-2 (clock low, cross path)
**   chop_inversion   v_rev/v_fwd — a true 4-gate modulator gives ~ -1 (sign proof +
**                    straight/cross symmetry in one number); a pass-gate placeholder
**                    (no cross path) gives ~0 (output floats/holds toward 0 via RLOAD)
**
** Assumes the differential pass-pair port order:
